      "writtenOn": "2023-05-19T16:45:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s what `assembleExpression(left)` will do. If the expression is simple, it returns it verbatim. If the expression is complex, it emits statements (generating the scratch variable) and returns a proxy that stands in for the expression (the scratch variable\u0027s name).",
      "parentUuid": "c645e90f_e8b0855b",
